{"id":"nave:sarah","source":"nave","name":"Sarah","slug":"sarah","seeAlso":["Serah"],"entries":[{"text":"Wife of Abraham Ge 11:29-31; 12:5","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",11,29,11,31],["Gen",12,5,12,5]]},{"text":"Near of kin to Abraham Ge 12:10-20; 20:12","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",12,10,12,20],["Gen",20,12,20,12]]},{"text":"Abraham represents her as his sister, and Abimelech, king of Gerar, takes her; she is restored to Abraham by means of a dream Ge 20:1-14","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",20,1,20,14]]},{"text":"Is sterile; gives her handmaiden, Hagar, to Abraham as a concubine Ge 16:1-3","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",16,1,16,3]]},{"text":"Her jealousy of Hagar Ge 16:4-6; 21:9-14","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",16,4,16,6],["Gen",21,9,21,14]]},{"text":"Her miraculous conception of Isaac Ge 17:15-21; 18:9-15","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",17,15,17,21],["Gen",18,9,18,15]]},{"text":"Name changed from Sarai to Sarah Ge 17:15","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",17,15,17,15]]},{"text":"Gives birth to Isaac Ge 21:3,6-8","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",21,3,21,3],["Gen",21,6,21,8]]},{"text":"Death and burial of Ge 23; 25:10","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Gen",23,0,23,0],["Gen",25,10,25,10]]},{"text":"Character of Heb 11:11; 1Pe 3:5,6","group":["1. Also called SARAI"],"refs":[["Heb",11,11,11,11],["1Pet",3,5,3,5],["1Pet",3,6,3,6]]}],"refCount":18}
